</a>
<a class="btn secondary" href="/signup">Create Account</a>
</div>
<div class="hero-assurance">
<span>&#10003; Verified student identities</span>
<span>&#10003; Agreed wages, upfront</span>
</div>
</div>
<aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="Student freelancing benefits">
